    "| **Aeromonas** | 1 | **48** | 0 | 1 | 0 | 50 |\n",
    "| **Parasit** | 0 | 0 | **25** | 0 | 0 | 25 |\n",
    "| **Jamur** | 0 | 2 | 0 | **23** | 0 | 25 |\n",
    "| **Overfeeding** | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | **4** | 4 |\n",
    "| **Total Prediksi** | 25 | 50 | 25 | 25 | 4 | **129** |\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.3 Tabel Hasil Pengujian Kinerja (Precision, Recall, F1-Score)\n",
    "\n",
